$MDESC::Type = "CTF Mixed";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Goopy Goo" @
         "\n<f1>Sector: <f0> 1693001" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Launch Time" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> After losing thier battle at the Shooter complex on the planet Goopy Goo the <vServer::teamName0> try to make a clean getaway in their last remaing class 2 Gun Ship. However, knowing that the <vServer::teamName0> would try this the <vServer::teamName1> have set up a blockade using thier class 2 Gun Ship. Now the real blood shed begins. Remember, no one can hear you scream in space." @
         "\n\n<f1>Map engineered and designed by:<f0> EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)" @
         "\n<f2>You can find this map at www.planetstarsiege.com/extreme or www.resistanceimaging.com/pms";


